; ── adjective concept nodes ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
; swarupa→visheshana marks these as adjectives
; kramanusara→property: what the adjective measures
; sthita→viveka-max/min: comparison direction
; pratipaksha→opposite: antonym pair
; naama: base + comparative + superlative word forms

